iate logistic regression was used to compare the 2000 difference in prevalence between the two groups of schools\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Logistic regression was conducted to compare prevalence in funded and nonfunded schools and was adjusted for respondent sex\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"In the multivariate analyses, sample clustering by school was represented in the analysis\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}